- MIMI, COME ON !
- I CAN'T DO IT.

502
00:36:22,848 --> 00:36:24,950
[ Booing ]

503
00:36:24,983 --> 00:36:28,754
- YOU CAN DO IT, I PROMISE.
- I THOUGHT I COULD DO IT,
