I DON'T KNOW IF I CAN
GO OUT THERE.

506
00:36:35,461 --> 00:36:39,298
YOU'VE GOT THE BEST VOICE.
I KNOW YOU CAN DO IT.
COME ON, PLEASE FOR ME.

507
00:36:39,331 --> 00:36:41,933
- OKAY, OKAY.
- THANK YOU.

508
00:36:41,967 --> 00:36:44,370
YOU OKAY ?
NO.

509
