* I LOVE ROCK AND ROLL

529
00:38:34,980 --> 00:38:38,083
* 'CAUSE IT SOOTHES MY SOUL
YEAH *

530
00:38:38,116 --> 00:38:40,419
* I LOVE ROCK AND ROLL

531
